{"name": "Heretic's Rapture", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"154\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/f7dda0797e004619aafef7f4ec4a1d19.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/f7dda0797e004619aafef7f4ec4a1d19.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/f7dda0797e004619aafef7f4ec4a1d19.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heretic\u2019s Rapture is a tetris-like, Tower-Defence, Deck-building,\u00a0 Bullet Heaven.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hell is overpopulated and demons are escaping to Earth. The Devil has hired you to manage the Heretic's Rapture system to send escaped souls back to the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/c2b3eb65459d799d0e746d8774ab47fd.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/c2b3eb65459d799d0e746d8774ab47fd.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/c2b3eb65459d799d0e746d8774ab47fd.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a tower out of tetris-like shapes to send escaped souls back to hell, where they belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/9b88aef3dff50339898e77522acdcf46.webp?t=1786732700\" width=\"20\"/></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Build a deck out of <strong>40+ shapes</strong> with unique effects and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/9b88aef3dff50339898e77522acdcf46.webp?t=1786732700\" width=\"20\"/></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Choose between <strong>15+ employees</strong> with special abilities, bound shapes, and differing row completion effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/9b88aef3dff50339898e77522acdcf46.webp?t=1786732700\" width=\"20\"/></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Loot &amp; Craft</strong> relics with powerful effects to help you slay demons with greater efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/9b88aef3dff50339898e77522acdcf46.webp?t=1786732700\" width=\"20\"/></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 Complete tasks &amp; unlock achievements to keep management happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/9b88aef3dff50339898e77522acdcf46.webp?t=1786732700\" width=\"20\"/></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Explore the Rapture Desktop interface to <strong>solve puzzles &amp; unlock secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/e37fc84358b3f474783c1caa10fb3e3b.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/e37fc84358b3f474783c1caa10fb3e3b.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/e37fc84358b3f474783c1caa10fb3e3b.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock</strong> over 15 powerful employees that have their own unique abilities, employee-specific shapes and even special row completion rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/3bfa98768ab19abe50a469f6f744aece.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/3bfa98768ab19abe50a469f6f744aece.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/3bfa98768ab19abe50a469f6f744aece.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experiment</strong> with over 40 shapes to create the perfect shape-deck that synergises with your chosen employee. Shapes have a range of effects. They can fire crucifixes, send unholy pulses, and buff other shapes with increased fire rate, extra projectiles and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/116e9fa88564cb63e9fd29dd8307a707.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/116e9fa88564cb63e9fd29dd8307a707.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/116e9fa88564cb63e9fd29dd8307a707.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot</strong> powerful relics that can be equipped and refined using an ARPG inspired crafting system. Select a buff, choose a modifier, and reroll stats to get the perfect build-defining relic to use on your next shifts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Didn't get anything useful? Sacrifice them at the altar for another chance at a game-breaking item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/4ee23f158683e00461239bcd90ab19e8.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/4ee23f158683e00461239bcd90ab19e8.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/4ee23f158683e00461239bcd90ab19e8.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> the Heretic's Desktop system to complete tasks, play minigames, solve puzzles, check the leaderboards and figure out why Klippy is so angry all the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b96d05651793eee3b278d8c1422495c7.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b96d05651793eee3b278d8c1422495c7.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b96d05651793eee3b278d8c1422495c7.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.poster.avif?t=1786732700\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.webm?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/extras/b608db2f533749bca72af22478c0a426.mp4?t=1786732700\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A sequel to Heretic's Fork.</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Hell is overpopulated and demons are escaping to Earth. Build a tower out of tetris-like shapes to create powerful synergies and send escaped souls back to hell, where they belong.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4332550/a45032349eb644e9756c9e8c58722cee84ef6ae3/header.jpg?t=1786732700", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "Strategy", "Deckbuilding", "Tower Defense", "Roguelite", "Loot"], "developers": "9FingerGames", "publishers": "9FingerGames", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4332550", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "8 May 2026 - Request Access\n\n6 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0cDcib8VkSk", "first_seen": 1778191200.0, "review_rank": 692}